// logic and PHASE10 notes for the full writeup.

// NOTE: custom (non-globalcat.2da) global variable names were confirmed
// this session to NOT persist in this engine build -- SetGlobalBoolean/
// SetGlobalNumber on any made-up name silently fails to stick, even
